    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Spartan Gallery is a responsive, multipurpose portfolio gallery plugin for WordPress. It works well for agencies, personal portfolios, architecture and photography studios, product showcases, artist portfolios, and blogs.</p>\n<p>Six layout styles are included: Freewall Chaotic, Random, Fixed, Pinterest, Hexagon, and 3D Slider. Each gallery has its own options panel to control image size, thumbnail behavior, container styling, and custom CSS, plus a Gutenberg block for adding galleries anywhere in the block editor.</p>\n<h4>Visit Example Site</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://freelancermartin.ee/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Spartan Gallery Official Site  </a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>See a how Spartan Gallery works</h4>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VF1u_1SLHjs?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<h4>Shortcode Parameters</h4>\n<pre><code>* page_id\n</code></pre>\n<h4>Basic example</h4>\n<pre><code>[spartan_gallery page_id=\"\"]\n</code></pre>\n",
        "installation": "<p>If installing the plugin from wordpress.org:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload or install the entire /spartan-gallery directory to the /wp-content/plugins/ directory, or install directly through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Activate Spartan Gallery through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Go to Spartan Gallery &gt; Add New to create a gallery.</li>\n<li>Upload images, choose a layout, and select image settings.</li>\n<li>Copy the shortcode (or use the Gutenberg block) wherever you&#8217;d like the gallery to appear.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "<p>coming soon</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.4.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed the Redux Framework dependency; the gallery options panel is now a native WordPress metabox (no third-party plugin required).</li>\n<li>Fixed images being stretched/distorted in all six layouts.</li>\n<li>Fixed several settings (thumbnail size, adjustable image, container settings) not saving correctly when turned off.</li>\n<li>Fixed slider controls not being usable in the options panel.</li>\n<li>Removed the &#8220;display text under image&#8221; caption feature.</li>\n<li>Various security hardening and bug fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Gutenberg block support.</li>\n<li>UI improvements and layout fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated user interface; new core class system for the plugin.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First stable release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Spartan Gallery is a responsive, multipurpose portfolio gallery plugin for WordPress. It works well for agencies, personal portfolios, architecture an &hellip;",
    "description": "<p>Spartan Gallery is a responsive, multipurpose portfolio gallery plugin for WordPress. It works well for agencies, personal portfolios, architecture and photography studios, product showcases, artist portfolios, and blogs.</p>\n<p>Six layout styles are included: Freewall Chaotic, Random, Fixed, Pinterest, Hexagon, and 3D Slider. Each gallery has its own options panel to control image size, thumbnail behavior, container styling, and custom CSS, plus a Gutenberg block for adding galleries anywhere in the block editor.</p>\n<h4>Visit Example Site</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://freelancermartin.ee/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Spartan Gallery Official Site  </a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>See a how Spartan Gallery works</h4>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VF1u_1SLHjs?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<h4>Shortcode Parameters</h4>\n<pre><code>* page_id\n</code></pre>\n<h4>Basic example</h4>\n<pre><code>[spartan_gallery page_id=\"\"]\n</code></pre>\n",
    "download_link": "https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/spartan-gallery.1.4.0.zip",
